    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Extending to approximately 115 sq. metres, the property offers generous and versatile accommodation throughout. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright and spacious sitting room with feature bay window, guest WC and a large open-plan kitchen/dining area. To the rear a sunroom provides valuable additional living space and access to the garden.\n\nUpstairs there are three well-proportioned bedrooms including a generous main bedroom with ensuite, together with a family bathroom and landing area.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a large paved driveway providing ample off-street parking, while its attractive brick façade and bay windows give the home excellent kerb appeal.\n\nSutton Court enjoys a particularly convenient location close to Dundalk town centre and within easy reach of local schools, shops, amenities and transport links making this an appealing option for families, first-time buyers or those looking for a well-located home in Dundalk.\n\nAccommodation includes: Entrance Hall • Sitting Room • Kitchen/Dining Room • Sunroom • Guest WC • Three Bedrooms • Ensuite • Family Bathroom\n\nApprox. floor area: 115 sq. metres\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with Greene Property.\n\nThis development boasts high quality finishes both internally and externally and, as a small development which rarely comes to the market these properties usually sell very quickly.\n\nPlease note: measurements and floor plans are approximate and are provided for identification and illustrative purposes only."
      },
